# held/weapons/greatsword: the greatsword (art weapon 7, `held greatsword.<form>`: every blade form until its own map lands): a 2 px blade of 15 to the point (the lit line step 3, the back step 2, a white point), a 6 px brass cross-guard, a 6 px leather grip for two fists 3 px apart (the main fist by the guard: the origin; the off fist 3 px behind it) and a pommel; 24 px (P2c wave 2, WEAPONS). STYLE_P2 11 / 25.7; P2C_CONTRACTS 4: the library weapon on the grip,
# a000..a337 = degrees counter-clockwise from screen-right, drawn once (D) for every facing; origin = the grip point
# under the main fist (the hand is drawn over the grip); `mark tip` at the far end. Drafted with the area's stepper (exact
# 1:0, 2:1, 1:1 and 1:2 runs, the top-left light by rule: a 2 px band's upper / left line lit) and hand-cleaned at 12x.
# Finish regions (contracts 3b): R the guard and pommel, G the pommel, P the flat, N the fuller (the rune line at T6).
use person
body adult
role held greatsword
role held greatsword.straight
role held greatsword.leaf
role held greatsword.falchion
role held greatsword.scimitar
role held greatsword.khopesh
role held greatsword.wavy
role held greatsword.broad
role held greatsword.curved
role held greatsword.glaive
layer held
anchor grip
keys held
tags anyfacing
